WEBVTT

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:23.090
Good morning!

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.880
They got you workin' the mornin' shift, huh?

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.400
Oh, I don't mind. I feel a proper welcome is the best way to brighten everyone's day.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.040
Yeah! Getting greeted by Reika makes me ready for anything!

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.110
She's the very model of politeness!

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.950
Yayoi-san, Nao!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.040
Morning!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.380
No one deserves the post like you do!

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.850
Yeah!

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.450
What post are we talking about?

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.620
Well, duh!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.570
Let's Go: Star!

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:49.620
Introducing your candidate for student council president, Aoki Reika!

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:50.950
Yay!

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:51.850
Umm...

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.760
I mean, the election's coming up soon, right?

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.690
What's an election?

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.570
It's when we choose a leader for the student body.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.000
A word from the candidate, please!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.470
I'm terribly sorry, but...

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.240
...I have no intention to run.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.870
That's change you can count on!

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.870
"I have no intention to run!"

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:09.980
...What?

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.510
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:16.380
Smile Precure!

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.250
Let's go!

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.780
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:19.910
All together!

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:21.520
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.720
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.390
Smile Precure!

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.230
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:36.700
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.870
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.800
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:52.680
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:52.680
So bright!

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:57.930
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:04.020
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.860
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.020
Let's go!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.610
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.650
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:16.450
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.030
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.580
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:19.790
Everybody!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.290
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.040
Fly to the future!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:27.540
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.650
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.020
Smile Precure!

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:39.420
I do not believe I would be a suitable person for the post.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.410
Why not?

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:44.840
As president, it would be my duty to lead the student body along the true path.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.250
However, I'm not sure I know what that path is myself.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.900
Reika, let's be honest. If you ain't up to the job, then no one is.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.720
Yeah, she's right!

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.460
I appreciate your support, but...

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.720
We can't force her, guys.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.800
Yeah, I know. Sorry, guess we got over-excited.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.830
I must apologize for letting you all down, too.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.310
Did you call, President?

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.210
You <i>did</i> finish the cleaning, I take it?

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:19.810
Of course, sir!

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.450
Then would you mind explaining what this is?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.170
I-I'm terribly sorry, sir!

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.050
President! You've gotta raise the basketball club's budget!

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.080
I think not.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.410
Remind me, our meeting at parliament was at 2 PM, was it not?

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.530
Your helicopter is waiting on the roof, sir.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.920
What is a student council president anyway-oni?

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.780
They're the most important student at their school, apparently-da wasa!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.870
Oh?

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:44.270
So if I was president of the student council...

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.330
Let me rub your shoulders, president!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.210
I've brought you your lunch, sir!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.800
I'd be able to make those pathetic humans my minions!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.210
Hrm... if it was me...

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.720
...I'd build an oni stronghold-oni!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.080
And I would...

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.560
...build a school of witchcraft and wizardry-da wasa!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.370
So how do we become student council president, anyway?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.830
I know just the thing for the job-da wasa!

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:13.000
All we need to do is wear these Humanificatorizers-da wasa!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:26.920
Outta the way!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.320
Don't you know who we are-oni?!

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.650
Clear the way, at once!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.460
We're your new transfer students!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.920
...And your candidates for student president!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.620
You'd better be grateful, punks-oni!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.060
What on earth...?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:46.530
Vice President, those transfer students have submitted their applications for presidency.

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:52.960
Have they, indeed? I feel a little fresh blood may actually be good for the health of our school.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.810
Listen up, you lot!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.920
I'm running for student council president! The name's Wolfe Runtarou!

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:04.080
And if you make me president, I'll ban homework forever!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.990
Think about it! After school you could play to your heart's content!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.460
Sounds good!

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.330
How very cheap.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.530
Huh?!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.560
I am Majo Lina!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:23.640
Vote for me, and you'll be allowed to eat sweets during lessons!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.920
That's nothing-oni!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.160
The name's Akai Onikichi!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:37.450
And I'll make it so you can bring comics and game consoles into school-oni!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.790
Are they crazy?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:43.680
Comics?!

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.960
Sweets!

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.400
Oh come on, you two!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.190
You can't buy into that nonsense.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:49.490
But we just wanna—!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.440
Now hold on just a second!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:55.330
The President does have a great deal of power! But that doesn't justify such irresponsible behavior!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.570
Reika-chan...

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.000
Ain't that the Prec— Ah, crap...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.670
And who the heck are you meant to be?!

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.750
Butt out, brat.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.720
Your proposals are misguided.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.180
Huh?!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:19.220
Powerful rhetoric, I will conceed. But I do not believe you have our school's interests at heart.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:23.090
Your thoughtless pandering makes you unsuited for the role of president!

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.460
What'd you say?!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:25.700
How about you butt out?

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:28.030
You're not the president around here!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.270
Then I suppose I shall have to run for the position!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:40.310
I can hardly stand back and watch you corrupt all our school stands for.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.720
What?!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.680
I shall lead this school down the correct path!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.120
What a pain-oni!

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.820
Fine, it's on!

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:54.110
But you'd better do some serious campaigning!

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.380
Well said, Reika!

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:00.630
We're right behind you!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.600
Thank you, everyone.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.080
Please vote for Aoki Reika!

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.880
Good luck in the vote!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.220
Thank you very much.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.650
Hey, runt!

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:20.710
Wolfe...

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.220
I think we said <i>our</i> piece pretty well yesterday...

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.820
But you never said what <i>you'd</i> do if you were president. Well?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:31.460
I'm glad you asked! You tell him, Reika!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.900
Well, umm...

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.900
...I would uphold the fine traditions of our school,

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:39.100
and make it a place of wholesomeness!

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:42.460
That doesn't tell me anything!

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:46.240
No fancy talk! What are you actually gonna <i>do?</i>

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.560
Actions...?

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.680
Well what about <i>you,</i> huh?

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:53.920
I told you yesterday. No more homework!

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.390
Great stuff, Runtarou!

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.700
That's wrong! Such a change would do no favors to anyone!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.040
These guys seem to think otherwise.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.740
And I'll make it so you can bring all the comics and games you want to school-oni!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:20.680
Vote for me, and it'll be all the sweets and cakes you can eat!

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:26.320
That's just not right! Comics, games, and sweets? That's just not right!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.360
This ain't lookin' good, not one bit!

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.080
Seems we win!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.330
I mean, it's not like you've got any policies of your own.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.370
All you can do is complain about ours!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.270
That's not what I—!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.270
Reika...

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.650
Aww crap! We're gonna lose if we don't come up with somethin' big!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.730
I fear Wolfe was probably correct, though.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:10.360
I chose to run for the position without knowing the proper path to take.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.730
Reika-chan...

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.930
I fear I am truly unsuitable to be president.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.630
That's not true!

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.600
Look, Reika-chan. All you have to do is find an idea people can get behind.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.140
Get behind?

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:25.470
Yeah, ya know. Ya can't win an election without makin' yourself popular.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:26.900
Maybe so...

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:37.390
But I do not believe fishing for popularity is the path towards proper leadership.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.030
You have a point, but...

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.010
But what path should I take...?

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.580
Beauty!

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.550
Candy!

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:13.980
We'll now hear speeches from each of the students running for the position of council president.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.920
I'll hand the floor over to them.

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.220
Alright, me first!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.820
My policy is...

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.060
...to ban homework!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.600
All comics, all games, all the time!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.970
All the sweets and cakes you could want!

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.410
Go for it, Reika-kuru!

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.550
Shh!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.070
I dunno, though...

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.280
You think she can pull it off?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.610
And finally, Aoki Reika-san.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:44.410
Ah, yes!

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:57.890
If there is a path for me to follow, it is the path of my own convictions.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:01.760
I'm sure they shall find due support.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.160
My name is Aoki Reika.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:08.240
It is my wish that this school remains tidy, welcoming, and appealing.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.940
Tidy, through continued cleaning of the school and its grounds.

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.910
Welcoming, through our provision of greeters at the school gates.

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:13.910
You can do it, Reika!

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.640
And appealing, through tending to the flora around the school.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:17.340
Firstly, it's—

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.410
Like hell are we gonna spend our time cleaning!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:24.090
Under my leadership, there'll be no cleaning, and no studying!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:30.560
Cleanliness and purity is not just about our school grounds, but about our hearts! It's important!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:35.000
Is it? If that's such a great thing, then I'm sure everyone will be happy to defend it!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.000
Yeah!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.730
Very well.

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:41.940
A round of applause from anyone who doesn't wanna study and clean all day!

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:48.910
Now it's your turn.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:55.280
I would ask for applause from all those willing to assist in keeping our school clean.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:01.190
Huh?

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:06.660
Oh crap...

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.230
See what I mean?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.320
<i>No...! Why don't they see...?</i>

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.700
Look at the pathetic little Precure-oni!

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.370
How about you just give up?

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.980
Yeah! Go home to mommy-oni!

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:29.620
Our Humanificatorizers came off-da wasa!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.990
Majorina! Akaoni!

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:33.820
They disguised themselves as humans?!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.350
Our plans, ruined-da wasa!

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.270
Wait, we can't be council president anymore-oni?!

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.100
Time to scamper-da wasa!

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.550
You cowards!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.730
Then does that mean that you are—?!

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.300
Dang it! So much for playing undercover...

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.510
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.440
...a Bad End!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.980
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:05.520
Wolfrun!

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:14.000
The Bad Energy we gather from these humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot{-sama}!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.500
Not so fast!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.230
Reika!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.200
Let's transform!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:22.900
Right!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:27.690
Ready?

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.120
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.140
Go!

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.990
Go, go!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.490
Let's go!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.010
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.170
Cure Happy!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.000
Dazzling sun!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.800
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:01.540
Cure Sunny!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.160
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.270
Cure Peace!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.940
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.990
Cure March!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.960
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.760
Cure Beauty!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.520
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:14:38.630 --> 00:14:42.820
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:46.220
There you all are, Precure!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.540
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.300
Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.470
Hyper!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.400
Hyper Akan!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.460
My friends!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:09.680
Now it's your turn!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.950
Guess you're gonna lose this fight as hard as you're gonna lose the vote!

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:21.420
As long as my leadership is true, I'm sure my fellow students will trust in me!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.890
Oh, don't be so naïve!

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:27.390
How can you call it true leadership if no one's following you?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.230
Beauty!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.570
That's more like it!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.040
Why...?

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:42.510
Kid yourself all you like! You and I both know it's drivel!

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:45.480
You talk way too serious! No one cares!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:49.240
And nobody's gonna want you telling them what to do!

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.450
That's not true!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:57.260
I don't like cleaning, or studying...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.830
See? <i>She</i> gets it!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:07.200
...but Reika was able to show me just how important they really are!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:13.540
Yeah... it's a pain, and I don't wanna have to do it...

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.380
...but Reika can inspire me not to run from things like that!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:19.710
'xactly! I'd be happier with no homework too, ya know!

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:24.010
But ya know what? There's a damn good reason I support Reika!

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:28.390
Aww, cause she's your iddle-widdle friend? Biased too now, are we?

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:33.230
No! I just know Reika cares more than anyone 'bout our school!

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:39.230
That's why we know she's the best person to be president of the student council!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:41.950
You all truly...?

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:46.470
So what if you do? No one else seems to think so! You're outvoted!

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.310
Maybe we are...

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:52.720
Maybe the others don't understand yet!

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:56.750
And I dunno how we'll get them to understand,

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.640
but you know what?!

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:01.020
I know they'll see the light eventually!

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.290
Because... thanks to her leadership...

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:07.900
<i>...we</i> understand Reika's vision!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.410
These brats are just delusional!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.980
Beauty!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:24.070
Thank you, everyone.

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:28.150
You've made me realize the importance of conveying myself properly.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:32.910
I promise that I shall not give up until my message has reached all my fellow students!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.540
That is the path I must follow!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.390
You sure love your pretty speeches!

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.130
To the finale!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.410
Right!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:56.680
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:02.580
Precure: Princess Form!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.560
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.490
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.040
May the light of hope shine!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.810
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:26.530
Precure...

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.430
Royal Rainbow...

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.790
Burst!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.190
Akanbe...!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.530
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.940
Another new Décor-kuru!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.340
I'm not giving up yet!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.380
We'll settle this in the election!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.970
I would want nothing less.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.680
Wait, you ain't leavin'?!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.850
We'll now ask Aoki Reika-san to resume her speech.

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.420
I hand the floor to you.

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:10.420
Reika-chan...

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.220
Go for it!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.520
Kuru!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.530
My name is Aoki Reika.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:23.730
It is my wish that this school remains tidy, welcoming, and appealing.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.570
You're wasting your breath!

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:30.070
I know you all probably find cleaning, or daily greetings a chore.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:33.540
For some, maybe even something you find difficult to handle.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:37.950
But think of the difference a simple greeting can make, if you can summon the courage.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:41.700
Simple words that can bring joy to both you and those you welcome.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.450
They can be the start of wonderous new friendships.

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:47.160
And think of the difference keeping our school clean makes.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:53.290
A clean school is pleasant, and keeping it clean feels good!

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:56.760
I'd also like you to consider what benefits flowers bring to our school.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:20:00.370
When you feel down, and things are not going your way,

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:03.670
they'll always lift your spirits.

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.810
It's my belief that these simple acts...

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:09.880
...will help inspire wonderful friendships among us all.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:16.770
I want to ensure that the time we all spend together is one we can all enjoy.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:20.980
I know that we will all ensure times of sadness and hardship.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:25.630
But if we ensure that there's always someone there to make us feel welcome,

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.890
then school will never have to feel like a chore.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:32.130
That is the future for this school I invision!

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:36.700
I know it may seem "over-serious" or boring to many of you,

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:40.520
but this is a matter very dear to my heart.

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:43.810
All I can ask of you is that you help me to realize that dream.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.740
Thank you.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.640
See? You're wasting your time!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.070
The heck?! How is this happening!

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:32.010
The votes have been tallied, and I am now able to announce that our new student council president...

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:33.140
Is me, right?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:37.130
...is Aoki Reika-san, from Class 2-2!

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:38.070
Alright!

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:39.500
She did it!

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:47.380
Are these runts insane?! They've gotta be!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.050
Reika-chan!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:57.360
Congratulations!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:00.810
Thank you, everyone!

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:39.970
Wait!

00:23:40.700 --> 00:23:41.540
What the heck?!

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:42.570
We've...

00:23:42.570 --> 00:23:44.670
...turned into little kids!

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:45.570
Goo goo-kuru

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:47.840
Let's play tag!{TLC: turns out this line and the next are a classic kiddy taunt for starting a game of tag http://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q1231316397 I'll go ahead and put something here, but it's nothing special.}

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:49.110
Better run, slowpokes-oni!

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:50.480
Okay!

00:23:50.480 --> 00:23:53.620
Wait, Wolfrun and Akaoni have turned into kids too!

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.380
I've got you now, Cure March!

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:57.420
Wait, I'm it?!

00:23:57.920 --> 00:23:59.220
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.190
Find your ultra happy smile!
